00:20:38.575 --> 00:20:39.385
Symptom:

330
00:20:39.665 --> 00:20:41.969
Everyone calls one service synchronously.

331
00:20:42.249 --> 00:20:44.681
Measure (L2): highest sync fan-in.

332
00:20:46.031 --> 00:21:04.591
Architecture fitness functions (Ford, Parsons and Kua, Building Evolutionary Architectures) turn these into CI checks over a machine-readable catalog of services, dependencies and databases (Backstage catalog, OpenAPI or AsyncAPI specs, tracing data).

333
00:21:04.871 --> 00:21:18.781
L2 shows the before graph FAIL (2 cycles, 6-hop chain, 2 shared databases, 10 synchronous dependencies for checkout) and the after graph PASS (no cycles, 2 hops, no shared databases, 6 dependencies).

334
00:21:20.131 --> 00:21:21.539
The modular monolith.

335
00:21:21.819 --> 00:21:36.581
One deployable unit made of modules with enforced boundaries: each module owns its data (its own schema and tables), exposes a small API, and communicates with others through that API or in-process events.

