470
00:29:50.687 --> 00:30:09.418
Goals: any service deployable alone on any day; checkout available ≥ 99.9 %; order-details page p99 at most 300 ms; clear ownership of every table and API; a repeatable way to add capabilities and retire legacy.

471
00:30:09.698 --> 00:30:17.655
