1090
01:12:16.813 --> 01:12:19.181
Microservices by bounded context.

1091
01:12:19.461 --> 01:12:21.232
Need data from another service:

1092
01:12:21.512 --> 01:12:25.309
Its API (now) or its events (a local copy or read model).

1093
01:12:25.589 --> 01:12:27.040
A, then B, then A calls:

1094
01:12:27.320 --> 01:12:29.283
Replace one direction with an event.

1095
01:12:29.563 --> 01:12:31.483
Screen needs several services:

1096
01:12:31.763 --> 01:12:35.112
BFF composition: parallel, timeouts, budgets.

1097
01:12:35.392 --> 01:12:36.693
Legacy replacement:

1098
01:12:36.973 --> 01:12:39.469
Strangler fig with shadow diff and canary.

1099
01:12:39.749 --> 01:12:41.520
Keep architecture from eroding:

1100
